      "source_text": "看见您已经不在，正想着是怎么回事，就看到您独自兴冲冲地登山去了。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "and saw that you were already gone. I was wondering what had happened when I saw you hurrying up the mountain all by yourself in high spirits.",
          "g": "predicate"
